<title>UK: Cadbury up as broker repeats buy advice.</title>
<headline>Cadbury up as broker repeats buy advice.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Cadbury Schweppes rose 8p to 514-1/2p on Thursday as broker ABN AMRO Hoare Govett repeated its &quot;buy&quot; recommendation on the stock, market sources said.</p>
<p>&quot;It's nothing dramatic, they've just re-iterated their buy stance ahead of the figures and feel there are opportunities for organic growth in confectionery,&quot; said one.</p>
<p>Hoare Govett analysts were not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>Cadbury is due to report first-half results on September 4.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8712</p>
